# This file exists ONLY for the Prisma CLI, which reads apps/api/.env when you
# run `prisma migrate` / `prisma studio` from this workspace. It is NOT read by
# the application: there is no dotenv anywhere in the server, so the running app
# takes its configuration from the real process environment.
#
# Configure the app from the ROOT .env.example instead — copy that to .env at
# the repo root. Deliberately no JWT_SECRET here: a secret in this file would be
# used by nothing while looking like it were in effect, and the placeholder that
# used to live here is now rejected outright at boot.
#
# See README.md -> Configuration.

DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"
